#. Type: select
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid "Default Node.js version to install:"
msgstr "Standardversionen av Node.js som ska installeras:"

#. Type: select
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid "update-node-alternatives can download a Node.js version through the bundled nvm and register it as the system-wide alternative right after the package is configured."
msgstr "update-node-alternatives kan ladda ner en Node.js-version via det inbäddade nvm och registrera den som systemomfattande alternativ direkt efter att paketet har konfigurerats."

#. Type: select
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid ""
" - \"latest LTS\" installs the most recent Long-Term Support release;\n"
" - \"latest\" installs the most recent Node.js release;\n"
" - \"none\" leaves the system without a Node.js version (the default);\n"
" - \"custom\" lets you type a specific version string (e.g. v22.14.0,\n"
"   lts/jod, 20)."
msgstr ""
" - \"latest LTS\" installerar den senaste Long-Term Support-versionen;\n"
" - \"latest\" installerar den senaste Node.js-versionen;\n"
" - \"none\" lämnar systemet utan en Node.js-version (standardvärdet);\n"
" - \"custom\" låter dig skriva in en specifik versionssträng (t.ex. v22.14.0,\n"
"   lts/jod, 20)."

#. Type: select
#. Description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid "Choosing \"none\" is always safe: you can install or change the active version later with `update-node-alternatives --install <version>`."
msgstr "Att välja \"none\" är alltid säkert: du kan installera eller ändra den aktiva versionen senare med `update-node-alternatives --install <version>`."

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../templates:2001
msgid "Custom Node.js version to install:"
msgstr "Anpassad Node.js-version att installera:"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../templates:2001
msgid "Type the Node.js version string to install. Anything accepted by `update-node-alternatives --install` (and ultimately by nvm) works: a major number (22), a full version (v22.14.0), or an alias (lts/jod, lts/*, node)."
msgstr "Skriv in Node.js-versionssträngen som ska installeras. Allt som accepteras av `update-node-alternatives --install` (och slutligen av nvm) fungerar: ett huvudnummer (22), en fullständig version (v22.14.0) eller ett alias (lts/jod, lts/*, node)."

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:3001
msgid "Remove all installed Node.js versions on apt purge?"
msgstr "Ta bort alla installerade Node.js-versioner vid apt purge?"

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:3001
msgid "update-node-alternatives stores Node.js versions under /usr/local/share/nvm/, outside dpkg's tree. By default `apt purge` leaves that store untouched."
msgstr "update-node-alternatives lagrar Node.js-versioner under /usr/local/share/nvm/, utanför dpkg-trädet. Som standard lämnar `apt purge` det förrådet oförändrat."

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../templates:3001
msgid "When enabled, `apt purge` will also delete /usr/local/share/nvm/, along with every Node.js version installed through this package. The choice is recorded now and re-confirmed at purge time."
msgstr "När det är aktiverat, tar `apt purge` även bort /usr/local/share/nvm/, tillsammans med varje Node.js-version som installerats via detta paket. Valet registreras nu och bekräftas igen vid purge-tillfället."
